    "___CROSS VALIDATION:-\n",
    "\n",
    "- validation data will be obtained from the section of trained data.\n",
    "\n",
    "- we perform validation for cross validation.\n",
    "\n",
    "- cross validation says we have to perfrom the validation in such a way that the overfitting is treated.\n",
    "\n",
    "- average of the different accuracy of the samples = model accuracy.\n",
    "\n",
    "- GRID SEARCH_CV:\n",
    "- it is a predefined library ."
   ]
  },
  {
